  "description": "This charming Rustic Christmas Watercolor Clipart Collection.\nFeaturing festive evergreen wreaths, snow-covered cottages, Christmas trees, adorable gnomes, a friendly snowman, rustic lanterns, wooden sleighs and beautiful botanical arrangements, this collection captures the warmth of a traditional winter storybook.\nThe coordinated palette of forest green, muted sage, cranberry red, snowy white, warm cream and natural wood brown creates a timeless rustic Christmas aesthetic.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED\n– Christmas wreaths and evergreen arrangements\n– Decorated Christmas trees\n– Snow-covered cottages and woodland houses\n– Christmas gnomes and a friendly snowman\n– Rustic lanterns and decorative candle holders\n– Wooden sleighs and winter accessories\n– Poinsettia and holly arrangements\n– Festive baskets and gift decorations\n– Christmas bells and decorative ornaments\n– Winter birdhouses and cottage decorations\n– Christmas ice skates\n– Rustic planters and evergreen arrangements\n ART STYLE\nPremium watercolor and gouache-inspired illustrations with delicate translucent washes, soft dry-brush edges, subtle paper grain, natural evergreen details and a cozy vintage Christmas storybook aesthetic.\nThe collection combines rustic cottage charm, woodland greenery and traditional holiday colors for coordinated seasonal designs.\nFILE DETAILS\n– Theme: Woodland Christmas and winter cottage decor\n– Format: PNG\n– Intended use: Digital crafting and graphic design projects\nPlease review the product preview and included files before purchasing. Actual image dimensions, resolution, transparency and final file quantity depend on the supplied files.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>This charming Rustic Christmas Watercolor Clipart Collection.</p>\n<p>Featuring festive evergreen wreaths, snow-covered cottages, Christmas trees, adorable gnomes, a friendly snowman, rustic lanterns, wooden sleighs and beautiful botanical arrangements, this collection captures the warmth of a traditional winter storybook.</p>\n<p>The coordinated palette of forest green, muted sage, cranberry red, snowy white, warm cream and natural wood brown creates a timeless rustic Christmas aesthetic.</p>\n<p>WHAT’S INCLUDED</p>\n<p>– Christmas wreaths and evergreen arrangements<br>\n– Decorated Christmas trees<br>\n– Snow-covered cottages and woodland houses<br>\n– Christmas gnomes and a friendly snowman<br>\n– Rustic lanterns and decorative candle holders<br>\n– Wooden sleighs and winter accessories<br>\n– Poinsettia and holly arrangements<br>\n– Festive baskets and gift decorations<br>\n– Christmas bells and decorative ornaments<br>\n– Winter birdhouses and cottage decorations<br>\n– Christmas ice skates<br>\n– Rustic planters and evergreen arrangements</p>\n<p> ART STYLE</p>\n<p>Premium watercolor and gouache-inspired illustrations with delicate translucent washes, soft dry-brush edges, subtle paper grain, natural evergreen details and a cozy vintage Christmas storybook aesthetic.</p>\n<p>The collection combines rustic cottage charm, woodland greenery and traditional holiday colors for coordinated seasonal designs.</p>\n<p>FILE DETAILS</p>\n<p>– Theme: Woodland Christmas and winter cottage decor<br>\n– Format: PNG<br>\n– Intended use: Digital crafting and graphic design projects</p>\n<p>Please review the product preview and included files before purchasing. Actual image dimensions, resolution, transparency and final file quantity depend on the supplied files.</p>",
